# САУТ (PB_SETUP 1) on a
# six-car ЭД9М (G M P M MR GR), docs/brakes-dll-replacement.md "The rest",
# stage 3: set against openRTS's step by step (--klub shadow). Its switch
# (147) on: the aspects announced; КОМ (140), ГР (142) and УК (141) on its
# screen; a braking in V and lap for its coefficient; stopped within 560 m
# of a Ж: ОТП (145), on past it; stopped within 300 m of a КЖ: ПОД (144)
# and К20 (143), the ВК (405), on past it under 20 km/h; its switch off
# and on again on the move. The РБ (23) every 5 s, the ЭПК key 26, the
# 395 switch 2 (II 1, III 2, V 5), the controller 0 (5 zero, 7 the first
# notch), the reverser 1. RTS's air.
#
#   openrts-train-check <RTS root> --dll mdd_ED9M-0060 mdd_ED9M-0060_G mdd_ED9M-0060_M mdd_ED9M-0060_P
#       mdd_ED9M-0060_M mdd_ED9M-0060_MR mdd_ED9M-0060_GR --script tests/data/golden/ed9m_saut.script
#       --klub shadow
0    voltage 25000 50
0    line_limit 120
0    line_signal S1 600 7
0    line_signal S2 1500 2
0    line_signal S3 2300 1
0    line_signal S4 3400 7
1    switch 2 1
2    switch 35 1
# САУТ on; its screen's keys.
3    switch 147 1
5    press 140
7    press 142
9    press 142
11   press 141
13   press 141
# Off to about 40 km/h, then coasting; a braking (V, lap) for the
# coefficient, КОМ shows it.
20   switch 1 3
21   switch 0 5
23   switch 0 7
44   switch 0 5
50   switch 2 5
51.3 switch 2 2
68   press 140
70   switch 2 1
75   switch 0 7
92   switch 0 5
# Before the Ж: stopped some 300 m short, ОТП, on.
0    when 1050 switch 2 5
0    then 1.5 switch 2 2
0    then 20 switch 2 1
0    then 24 press 145
0    then 30 switch 0 7
0    then 45 switch 0 5
# Before the КЖ: stopped some 250 m short, ПОД and К20, the ВК, on past it
# slowly.
0    when 1990 switch 2 5
0    then 1.5 switch 2 2
0    then 20 switch 2 1
0    then 24 press 144
0    then 28 press 143
0    then 32 press 405
0    then 36 switch 0 7
0    then 46 switch 0 5
0    when 2200 switch 0 7
0    when 2260 switch 0 5
0    when 2400 switch 0 7
0    when 2700 switch 0 5
# Its switch off and on again on the move.
0    when 2800 switch 147 0
0    when 2850 switch 147 1
# The РБ every 5 s.
25   press 23
30   press 23
35   press 23
